---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Architecture Team | Sovrin Group" section="about">
  <div class="dark-zone page-dark">
  <section class="hero-page">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="kicker">About · Architecture Team</p>
      <h1>Guided by experienced and trusted leadership.</h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose">
      <p>
        Sovrin's architecture team builds governed systems that don't drift, don't degrade, and don't lose their identity over time. We combine deep expertise in identity governance, deterministic design, and AI alignment to create architectures that stay stable even as organizations evolve.
      </p>
      <p>
        We design systems where human intent is preserved, AI reasoning is contained, and every workflow operates inside a clear governance boundary. Our focus is long‑term continuity — ensuring identity, context, and accountability remain intact across every layer of the system.
      </p>
      <h2>Our architectural posture:</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Identity first, always</li>
        <li>Deterministic reasoning over probabilistic guesswork</li>
        <li>Governance as a structural property, not an add‑on</li>
        <li>Stability and alignment built into every layer</li>
      </ul>
      <p style="margin-top: 2rem;">
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/about/">Back to About</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  </div>
</Base>

